Subject: [PATCH] toolkit: pass resumed Journal identity to the Activity parser

Owner: sugar-toolkit; upstreamable. ActivityHandle is constructed from parsed
arguments by activityinstance, not from SUGAR_OBJECT_ID or SUGAR_URI. Live
Write saved content but reopening that object created an empty new document.
Preserve the existing command-line contract for object and URI launches.

--- a/src/sugar4/activity/activityfactory.py
+++ b/src/sugar4/activity/activityfactory.py
@@ -122,5 +122,9 @@
     command = [command[0], bundle.get_path(), *command[1:]]
     command.extend(["--activity-id", handle.activity_id])
+    if handle.object_id:
+        command.extend(["--object-id", handle.object_id])
+    if handle.uri:
+        command.extend(["--uri", handle.uri])
     environment = get_environment(bundle, handle)
     environment.pop("DISPLAY", None)
     environment.pop("WAYLAND_DISPLAY", None)
